The implementations in float.goml, power.goml, and trig.goml are adapted from
the Go 1.26 standard library math package, including sqrt.go, floor.go,
modf.go, frexp.go, ldexp.go, exp.go, log.go, pow.go, sin.go, tan.go, and
trig_reduce.go. The applicable Go, Sun Microsystems, and Cephes notices follow.

